5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should look at the incident logs and the time lost to copying records to see what actually hurts the staff.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"I agree with Daisuke, but we also need to check the staffing of the coordination group to see if anyone can actually manage this.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We can't ignore the technical side. I want to see the network coverage at customer plants and the vendor license pricing.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I am concerned about the money. I will check the capital budget and software allowance, and the vendor pricing as well.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know what happened before! I'll look into the outcomes of the last three rollouts and the standardization efforts.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, do you think the coordination group is the only bottleneck for the staff?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"Not the only one, but it's a start. I'll also look into the handling of vendor queries to see the clerical load.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, checking the budget is fine, but the pricing models for licenses often hide the real cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,That is exactly why I am looking at both the budget and the pricing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I think looking at the past is the only way to avoid repeating mistakes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
