35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I found that we lose an hour daily to copying records and have many misrouted deliveries due to inconsistent addresses.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"The coordination group is understaffed, and clerks are wasting time answering the same vendor queries repeatedly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It's a mess. Customer plants have terrible network coverage, and license costs climb with every new department added.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The capital budget is frozen, but we have room in the software allowance. However, those per-head licenses Shunichi mentioned are a risk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Past rollouts that required daily entry from everyone failed. Only narrow tools for specific trades survived.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, if the capital budget is frozen, does that mean we can only do software-based projects?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"And if the coordination group is empty, who is going to implement these tools without burning out?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, if ""daily entry"" tools fail, we should avoid anything that forces everyone to change their habits every day.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, we must stick to the software allowance. Anything requiring new hardware or capital spend is impossible.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly. We need something specialized, not a company-wide mandate that people will just ignore.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The address issue and copying records are daily pains. We need a solution for that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"But if the solution requires more manual data entry, the staff will just collapse.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"And if it's a field app, the network coverage issues I found will make it useless.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need to find a balance between the software budget and the actual utility.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,Let's see the candidates and see which one fits these constraints.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
